/E (Medicaps University is one of the leading private universities in Central India. Since its inception, the institution has consistently aimed at creating an ideal ambience for budding technocrats and helps them to grow like true professionals. We have an optimal blend of academic brilliance and industry exposure. This has helped us in refining the candidature of our graduating students from the engineering, management, agriculture, commerce, science, pharmacy, arts, humanities and social sciences, law, allied and healthcare, and journalism and mass communication field for the last 26 years.)
