/E (Our undergraduate program includes B.Tech degrees in various specializations. Our postgraduate program includes M.Tech degrees in Computer Science and Engineering, Electrical Engineering, Mechanical Engineering, Civil Engineering, Electronics and Communication, Information Technology and integrated M.Tech in CSE. With a focus on experiential learning and industry exposure, our programs provide students with the opportunity to work on real-world projects and gain hands-on experience in their field. Graduates from our programs have gone on to excel in a range of industries, including IT, manufacturing, construction, and telecommunications.)
